content:
Which of the following data sets has the greatest standard deviation?

A. {4, 4, 4, 4}
B. {1, 3, 5, 7}
C. {2, 2, 6, 6}
D. {0, 4, 4, 8}

Options: A) {4, 4, 4, 4} | B) {1, 3, 5, 7} | C) {2, 2, 6, 6} | D) {0, 4, 4, 8}

